# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# Salvaged object store from the 29.07.2026 corruption. Kept on disk in case
# anything else needs recovering from its dangling blobs; not part of history.
/.git.corrupt/

# Research source material. Contains raw survey exports, interview transcripts
# and respondent contact details — must never be committed or published. Only
# the aggregates in lib/data/thesis/ are safe, and those are generated from it
# by scripts/extract-thesis-data.py.
/Wszystkie aktualne pliki związane z pracą/

# NOTE: myfonts/ IS committed, deliberately. Druk Wide and Noirden are licensed
# commercial faces, and the app will not build without them — a backup that
# can't restore isn't a backup. This is fine while the repository is PRIVATE,
# as a personal archival copy.
#
# BEFORE MAKING THIS REPOSITORY PUBLIC: remove myfonts/ from history, or
# confirm the licences permit redistribution. scripts/build-webfonts.py
# regenerates the WOFF2 builds from the masters.

